OL,3,GNEWSAMajor donors help Rothbury Estate
OL,4,Abid move closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservation groups are inching closer
OL,7,Fto the #30m they need to buy the
OL,8,Fentirety of a vast upland estate.
OL,10,FThe Wildlife Trusts and Northumberland
OL,11,FWildlife Trust said they had received
OL,12,Fseveral major pledges in the past week
OL,13,F- worth about #5.5m in total - in a
OL,14,Fboost to their bid to buy the 3,800
OL,15,Fhectare (15-sq-m) Rothbury Estate in
OL,16,FNorthumberland.
OL,18,FThey have just under #4m left to fund
OL,19,Fraise by the end of October. They plan
OL,20,Fto boost wildlife, restore bogs and
OL,21,Fpromote nature-friendly farming on the
OL,22,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
